Text_NPikachuUnsure::
    .string "N: …Your PIKACHU is talking.\p"
    .string "It says it hasn't made up its\n"
    .string "mind about you yet.\p"
    .string "It walks beside you, but part of\n"
    .string "it is still listening for home.$"

Text_NPikachuFond::
    .string "N: …Your PIKACHU is talking.\p"
    .string "It says you're a little clumsy,\n"
    .string "but it likes walking with you.\p"
    .string "It's a warm voice.$"

Text_NPikachuDevoted::
    .string "N: …Your PIKACHU's voice is so\n"
    .string "clear!\p"
    .string "It says it would follow you\n"
    .string "anywhere, as far as you go.\p"
    .string "I've never heard a POKéMON say\n"
    .string "that about a person before.$"

Text_NNoPikachu::
    .string "N: …I can't hear your PIKACHU\n"
    .string "today. It isn't with you.\p"
    .string "Wherever it is, I think it's\n"
    .string "waiting for you.$"
